From 77605ddb199fcb1fb916f1d5107662dcdd01ef28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 12:53:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gi): Danica and Torrents of Spring presets

Buff amounts can come from a talent value (e.g. Burst "ATK Bonus Ratio"),
be capped by one, be multiplied at a constellation, and depend on a second
toggle. Buffs can come from the Elemental Skill or Burst and target the
active character. Talent effects can add stat bonuses to matching values.
Shields and Normal Attacks of skills are computed; "1-Hit Electro
DMG/Stellar-Conduct DMG" rows are split into two values.

Bonus effect labels no longer rename the stat everywhere (a textSuffix is
stored per stat path).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Asb8vZRqeTYT9zLpVizGNv
